    (k) THE RECEPTION STRIP IS DELETED per an explicit 2026-08-04 owner
        decision recorded in the copy file — the section now has THREE
        strips (fuel, travel, marketing), not four. The
        `/automations/reception` case-study page itself is untouched
        and stays live; only its homepage strip is gone. This also
        removes the LAST placeholder numbers from the page — as of
        round 6, every stat on this page is a real, verified number.
        Marketing's `tone` was reassigned from "muted" to "slate" now
        that Reception (which owned "slate") is gone and three tones
        exactly cover three strips; "muted"/neutral is no longer used
        anywhere on this page (see global.css for the resulting dead-
        class removal).
  Vision/Attitude, Way of Working, and Contact are UNCHANGED from the
  prior revision (verified word-for-word against the copy file below,
  not assumed).

  REVISED 2026-08-27 — FULL ALIGNMENT WITH THE HEBREW HOMEPAGE, per
  owner: "אותו הדבר באנגלית. שהקופי יהיה זהה כמה שאפשר ומותאם גלובלית":
    (l) Section order now matches HE: Hero -> VisionSection ->
        AchievementsStrip + QuotesStrip (merged proof block, flushBottom)
        -> StepsSection -> ContactForm. The two homepages are mirrors
        again, HE being the source this time.
    (m) All copy re-translated from the LIVE HE homepage strings
