        (travel + marketing shortened per the owner's 2026-08-26 HE
        decision), sublines and stat descriptions (aligned with the
        2026-08-27 de-dashed HE versions), link labels ("Full story"),
        vision paragraphs, the owner's full 5-stage process, and the
        trust/consulting-direction contact copy. NUMBERS UNTOUCHED:
        every stat value is byte-identical to the pre-alignment page.
    (n) QuotesStrip added (was HE-only): five real client quotes,
        faithful English translations of the verbatim Hebrew originals
        (see the const's comment below).
    (o) NO em dashes anywhere in the new copy (owner rule, 2026-08-27;
        same rule applied to the HE strips the same day).

  Copy source: .apm/memory/copy/homepage-en.md — re-read that file
  before editing any string below; it is the approved source of truth,
  not this file. That file's inline `*[polish: ...]*`/`*[Manager fix:
  ...]*` markers are editorial meta for the owner's review — never
  rendered here; only the resolved bullet text they annotate is used.

  PLACEHOLDER NUMBERS: NONE. As of round 6 (Reception's deletion),
  every stat value on this page is real and traceable to a real
  project (see CLAUDE.md, Content honesty). No `PLACEHOLDER`/
  `DO NOT SHIP`/`OWNER NUMBER NEEDED` markers remain anywhere in this
  file, `AchievementsStrip.astro`, or the built page — verified by grep
  before this round's commit. This page is launch-ready with respect to
  numbers.

  No imagery — round 3 dropped the image-slot idea along with
  CapabilityStrips; nothing to reserve here.
